/	SIMH ID PROGRAM.

/	ASSUMPTIONS:

/	1)	PROGRAM IS ACTUALLY RUNNING ON THE SIMH SIMULATOR.

/	2)	THE PEPS EXTENSIONS REGARDING 6057 ARE ENABLED.

/	STANDARD OPENING DEFAULTS APPLY.

	FIELD	0			/CAN RUN ON 4K MACHINES.

	*200				/THE USUAL STARTING ADDRESS.

/	THE FLAG MAY ALREADY BE UP; THIS WORKS IN BOTH OPERATING SYSTEMS.

	TSF				/FLAG ALREADY UP [P?S/8 STYLE]?
	TLS				/NO, RAISE IT NOW TO PRIME THE PUMP.

/	SETUP ASSUMING NOT ON THE SIMULATOR.

TEMP,	CLA CLL				/CLEAR AC AND LINK.

/	NOW EXECUTE 6057 AND SEE WHAT HAPPENS.

	6057				/HOPEFULLY MAGIC HAPPENED.
	DCA	TEMP			/SAVE IT FOR NOW.
	SZL				/SKIP IF NOT BETA
	JMP	ISBETA			/LEAVE MESSAGE ALONE IF BETA
	TAD	L7600/(7600)		/ANY NEGATIVE VALUE WILL DO.
	DCA	TRNKB			/SHORTEN STRING OUTPUT.

/	NOW FALL INTO SAME CODE AS IF BETA VERSION.

ISBETA,	TAD	TEMP			/GET VERSION BACK.
	RTL;RTL;RAL			/MOVE DOWN EIGHT BITS.
	AND	(17)			/JUST MAJOR VERSION BITS.
	TAD	("0)			/MAKE IT PRINTABLE.
	DCA	MAGVER			/STASH IN MESSAGE.
	TAD	TEMP			/GET VERSION BACK AGAIN.
	RTR;RTR				/MOVE DOWN FOUR BITS.
	AND	(17)			/JUST MINOR VERSION BITS.
	TAD	("0)			/MAKE IT PRINTABLE.
	DCA	MINVER			/STASH IN MESSAGE.
	TAD	TEMP			/GET VERSION BACK YET AGAIN.
	AND	(17)			/GET STEP RELEASE.
	TAD	("0)			/MAKE IT PRINTABLE.
	DCA	STPVER			/STASH IN MESSAGE.
LOOP,	TAD I	TXTPTR			/GET A CHARACTER
	SPA				/AT END OF LIST?
	JMP I	L7600/(7600)		/YES, EXIT TO OPERATING SYSTEM.
	TSF				/FLAG UP?
	JMP	.-1			/NO, WAIT FOR IT.
	TLS				/YES, OUTPUT IT NOW.
	CLA				/CLEAN UP
	ISZ	TXTPTR			/BUMP TO NEXT CHARACTER IN THE STRING.
	JMP	LOOP			/KEEP GOING.

/	DISPLAY STRING.

STRNG,	"M&37;"J&37;"M&37;"J&37;"M&37;"J&37;"S;"I;"M;"H;" 
	"V;"E;"R;"S;"I;"O;"N;" 
MAGVER,	.-.;	".
MINVER,	.-.;	"-
STPVER,	.-.
TRNKB,	" ;"B;"E;"T;"A
L7600,	7600				/WHERE OPERATING SYSTEM EXIT IS.  ALSO ENDS
					/THE TEXT STRING.
TXTPTR,	STRNG				/TEXT POINTER [ALREADY INITIALIZED].

	$				/THAT'S ALL FOLK!
